sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch14-09> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch14-09--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch14-09--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch14-09: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.60" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.596"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.61"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The predictor Thompson specifies, the diagonal ratio of the leaf rhomb rather than the divergence angle, is a concrete measurement and yields an obvious comparison. Existing sunflower images let a team measure rhombs, but floret shape hardly varies, and the fir-cones where scale proportions do vary lack a public morphometric table. The test is well posed and currently limited to whatever images an investigator is willing to digitize." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: On cones or other lattices, measure divergence angle and the ratio of the diagonals of each scale's circumscribed rhomb, and predict which parastichy family is visually dominant. The claim is supported if that diagonal ratio predicts the conspicuous family when divergence is held constant, and divergence does not predict it when the ratio is held constant." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Sunflower florets are similar in proportion, so they provide little independent variation in the rhomb.", "Cone-scale proportions and divergence are not tabulated together in an open multi-species file." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch14-09--grok--dataset-1> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch14-09--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch14-09 by Grok 4.7: 0.84" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.84"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch14-09--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch14-09> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch14-09--grok--operationalizability> .
